  triage:fixCommit "fb697d14d" ;
  triage:fixBranch "feature/ay8-herdr-socket-transport" ;
  triage:verifiedInRound "qa-pr1280-r3" ;
  triage:resolutionNote "transport_fixture.rs:170-219 adds socket_get() using atm_herdr::testing::production_invoker_with_test_socket against a real FakeHerdrSocket (Unix listener / Windows named pipe), and every_manifest_is_equivalent_over_cli_and_socket_transports asserts socket==cli per manifest for every fixture. Both transports now run the same ADR-058 adapter equivalence suite through production invokers; AC3 met." .